    <section id="about">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>Wander Walls is an iOS spatial scavenger hunt game where players scan a room, place illustrated mural scenes on nearby walls, and find hidden objects by tapping them in augmented reality.</p>

      <h3>What the app does</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Uses camera and AR features to scan a room and anchor game scenes to walls.</li>
        <li>Displays illustrated scavenger hunt scenes with target objects to find.</li>
        <li>Saves local gameplay progress, selected pack, completion status, star ratings, and basic play statistics.</li>
        <li>Offers free packs and optional paid content packs through Apple In-App Purchase.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Free and paid content</h3>
      <p>Wander Walls includes free content packs and optional paid scene packs. Paid packs are one-time in-app purchases unless otherwise shown in the App Store purchase sheet. Purchase availability, prices, taxes, and storefront behavior are handled by Apple.</p>

      <h3>AR and safety notes</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Use Wander Walls in a safe indoor area with enough room to move.</li>
        <li>Stay aware of furniture, people, pets, stairs, fragile objects, and other hazards.</li>
        <li>Children should use the app with adult supervision.</li>
        <li>AR wall detection and room scanning may be inaccurate, unavailable, or interrupted depending on device capability, lighting, motion, room layout, and operating system behavior.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="muted">Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
